<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest upgrades Lloyds.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest upgrades Lloyds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities upgraded its earnings forecasts for Lloyds TSB Bank on Friday, following a string of other broker upgrades.</p>
<p>NatWest boosted its 1997 and 1998 earnings estimates seven percent to 3.32 billion and by four percent to 3.83 billion, respectively.</p>
<p>It raised its 1999 estimates by five percent to 4.441 billion.</p>
<p>On Thursday, ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, SBC Warburg and Merrill Lynch upgraded the stock.</p>
<p>On June 11, HSBC Capel upgraded its rating.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
